Description: A general-purpose client for Skosmos REST APIs. Provides tools to
    discover vocabularies, search and look up concepts, browse semantic
    relationships, retrieve statistics and indexes, inspect recently changed
    concepts, and download RDF data from any standards-compatible Skosmos
    instance. Client configuration supports custom endpoints, headers,
    authentication tokens, timeouts, retries, and user agents.
